# Persistence (W0). SQLite for dev; switch the provider in prisma/schema.prisma + this URL
# to a Postgres connection string for production (D4).
# NOTE: a `file:` URL is resolved relative to the schema dir (prisma/), so `../.data`
# puts the db in apps/api/.data alongside the legacy flat files the importer reads.
DATABASE_URL="file:../.data/workspace.db"
